Software Construction & Maintenance – Lab 09

Course: Software Construction (5th Semester Software Engineering)  
Institution: University of Engineering and Technology, Abbottabad Campus  
Instructor: Engr. Rizwan Shah  

Overview

This repository contains the complete implementation for **Lab 09**, focusing on core software maintenance principles: identifying and removing code smells, enforcing defensive domain boundaries, implementing diagnostic log observability, and building isolated automated unit tests using JUnit 5.

## Project Directory Structure

